  "name": "Beef Tagine with Oranges",
  "recipeYield": "4 servings",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "1-2 tbsp ghee or 1 tbsp olive oil + 1 tbsp butter",
    "3-4 garlic cloves (crushed)",
