    "5cm/2” fresh ginger (peeled and finely chopped or grated)",
    "1 fresh red chilli (deseeded and sliced)",
    "2 tsp coriander seeds",
    "2 cinamon sticks",
    "2-4 beetroot (peeled and quartered)",
    "500g beef (cubed or cut in strips)",
    "2 thin skinned oranges (cut into segments)",
    "1 tbsp dark clear honey",
    "1-2 tbsp orange flower water",
    "1 tbsp butter",
    "2-3 tbsp shelled pistachios",
    "leaves from a small bunch of fresh flat leaf parsley (roughly chopped)"
